@startuml
title UML State Transition Diagram for Staff Member Management

[*] --> Unassigned

state Unassigned
Unassigned --> Assigned : Assign

state Assigned
Assigned --> Unassigned : Remove Assignment
Assigned --> Assigned : Switch Assignment
Assigned --> Unemployed : Leave Job

state Unemployed
Unemployed --> Archived : Archive

state Archived
Archived --> [*]

@enduml
